{"title":"全过程工程咨询驶入快车道","date":"2018-04-24","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\ncolor:#1D1D1D;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:ZH-CN;mso-bidi-language:\r\nAR-SA\">全过程工程咨询驶入快车道</span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"color: rgb(29, 29, 29); font-size: 14pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt;\">近日，广东省住房和城乡建设厅发布《建设项目全过程工程咨询服务指引（咨询企业版）（征求意见稿）》和《建设项目全过程工程咨询服务指引（投资人版）（征求意见稿）》，对全过程工程咨询服务的内容和开展形式进行了具体规定，其中亮点如下：</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\ncolor:#1D1D1D\">《建设项目全过程工程咨询服务指引》分为<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">咨询企业版和投资人版</span></strong>两个版本，主要内容一致，针对投资人和咨询企业的工作内容作了具体规定。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\ncolor:#1D1D1D\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">2.</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">全过程工程咨询</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">包括项目的全过程工程<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;\r\npadding:0cm\">项目管理</span>以及投资咨询、勘察、设计、造价咨询、招标代理、监理、运行维护咨询以及<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>咨询等专业咨询服务。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">3.</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">全过程工程咨询单位</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">：具有国家现行法律规定的与工程规模和委托工作内容相适应的勘察、设计、监理、造价咨询等资质，可以是<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">独立咨询单位或（总分包性质的）联合体</span></strong>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">4.</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">总<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;\r\npadding:0cm\">咨询师</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">：全过程工程咨询机构委派或投资人指定，具有相关资格和能力为建设项目提供全过程工程咨询的项目总负责人，原则上由具有注册建筑师、注册结构工程师及其他勘察设计注册工程师、注册造价工程师、注册<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;\r\npadding:0cm\">监理工程师</span>、注册建造师、注册咨询工程师中一个或多个执业资格的人员担任。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">5<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">.</span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">专业咨询工程师</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">：主要包括但不限于以下专业人士：注册建筑师、注册结构工程师及其他勘察设计注册工程师、注册造价工程师、注册监理工程师、注册建造师、注册咨询工程师等及相关执业人员。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">6.</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\ncolor:#1D1D1D\">全过程工程咨询可划分为<b>项目决策、勘察设计、招标采购、工程施工、竣工验收、运营维护<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">六个阶段</span></strong></b>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">7.</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\ncolor:#1D1D1D\">全过程工程咨询单位应为<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">一家</span></strong>具有相应资格要求的<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">单位（或联合体）</span></strong>，如为联合体，应明确牵头单位，且<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">总咨询师应由牵头单位派出</span></strong>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">8.</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\ncolor:#1D1D1D\">专业咨询工作<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">可以分包</span></strong>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">9.</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\ncolor:#1D1D1D\">全过程工程咨询服务收费，应在<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">工程概算中列支</span></strong>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">10.</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">投资人应与全过程工程咨询单位签订<b>全过程工程咨询合同</b>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">11.</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">全过程工程咨询单位条件</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">：具有国家现行法律规定的与项目规模和委托工作内容相适应的工程咨询、规划、勘察、设计、造价咨询、工程监理等相关资质。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">12.</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#1D1D1D\">总咨询师的条件</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">：取得工程建设类注册执业资格（注册建筑师、注册结构工程师及其他勘察设计注册工程师、注册造价工程师、注册<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;\r\npadding:0cm\">监理工程师</span>、注册建造师、注册咨询工程师等一个或多个执业资格）或具有工程类、工程经济类高级职称，并具有与项目要求相匹配的能力和类似工程经验等。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\ncolor:#1D1D1D\">（注：总<span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\nnone windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm\">咨询师</span>的条件，可以说还是比较宽泛的，各个专业的注册执业人员均可担任，具有高级职称也可担任）<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">13.</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;color:#1D1D1D\">投资人可采用直接委托、竞争性谈判、竞争性磋商、邀请招标、公开招标等方式<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">选择全过程工程咨询单位</span></strong>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 25.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\ncolor:#1D1D1D\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>"}